From 63ad363b7cccfccf46f01a0a50a01f8cc5dcd44f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rob Crittenden <rcritten@redhat.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Jan 2026 13:31:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] Implement more PQ testing for both NSS and OpenSSL

This adds keyiread and csrgen tests for both NSS and
OpenSSL. keyiread, keygen and csrgen will now run by
default when PQ is enabled.

It also fixes the 028-dbus test if PQ is not enabled either
by configuration (--disable-ml-dsa) or because it isn't
available.
